('74', '3.0.4.0', '## What&#039;s Changed<br />\r\n* currency rates refresh bugfix by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/12810<br />\r\n* Fix marketing message counter by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/12868<br />\r\n* Corrections to .htaccess.txt by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/12910<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Added DB_PREFIX backup controller by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/12975<br />\r\n* attribute automcomplete fix by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/12990<br />\r\n* PHP 8 - null parameter by @opencartbot in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13019<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Wrong message on Manufacturer List by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13029<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Added language variable &#039;text_no_results&#039; for Manufacturer … by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13030<br />\r\n* Fix redirect protection by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13095<br />\r\n* Fix pagination bug in the Google Base extension by @opencartbot in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13100<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Fixed PHP 8 warning Laybuy model by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13244<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Typo fraudlabspro model by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13303<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x]Typo&#039;s sale report model by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13307<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x]Typo&#039;s return report model by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13308<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Removed duplicated values from array - utf8 helper by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13384<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Create phpstan.neon by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13386<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Create Lint.yml by @condor2 in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13387<br />\r\n* [3.