art/pull/13665<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] updates for payment extensions by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13681<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Upgrade Paypal to Version 2.2.1 by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13691<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Remove duplicate array key by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13692<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] remove old pp_express recurring by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13693<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Add missing type cast for PayPal by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13697<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Add missing escape to filter moule by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13698<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Fix timezone change breaking session and API by @ADDCreative in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13704<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Bugfix backup tool by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13709<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Improved security for account forgotten by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13710<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Improved security for admin forgotten by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13714<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Pagination fixes by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13716<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] More pagination fixes by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13732<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Windows line endings by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13734<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] PayPal upgrade by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13736<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Minir bugfix for PayPal by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13737<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Security patch by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13741<br />\r\n* [3.0.x.x] Add missing type cast for PayPal by @mhcwebdesign in https://github.com/opencart/opencart/pull/13