('65', '4.0.0.0', 'Its finally here! OpenCart 4.0.0.0. After many years hard work.<br />\nADDED:<br />\n- PHP 8.1+ Compatibility<br />\n- New event based extension system<br />\n- Startup page &amp; CRON job page<br />\n- GDPR &amp; Cookie accept policy<br />\n- Product variants<br />\n- Admin notification system &amp; Autoloader class<br />\nUPDATED:<br />\n- Bootstrap 5, jQuery v3.6.0, Font Awesome 6, CKEditor 5<br />\n- Renamed order_recurring to subscription system.', 'opencart-4.0.0.0.zip', 'opencart-4.0.0.0.zip', 'https://github.com/opencart/opencart/releases/download/4.0.0.0/opencart-4.0.0.0.zip', '2022-05-24 11:02:18'),
